(289986, 181, 216, 'We will start the English language course for children. I will write the explanation with the worksheets and any inquiries send a private message :rev', 'We will start the English language course for children. I will write the explanation with the worksheets and any inquiries send a private message :revolving-hearts:', 0, 0, 'image', NULL, '2022-07-15 02:31:32', '2022-07-15 02:31:32'),
(289987, 181, 216, 'UNIT 1:\\n\\n&nbsp;how to understand and respond to different classroom commands.\\n\\nTeach essential action verbs that students will need throughout the', 'UNIT 1:\\n\\n&nbsp;how to understand and respond to different classroom commands.\\n\\nTeach essential action verbs that students will need throughout their English study life.\\n\\nLearn to give and follow orders using short phrases in the imperative mood.\\n\\nIntroduce the concept of TPR (Total Physical Response) as a language learning method which will be used very often in future lessons.\\n\\nsit down\\n\\nstand up\\n\\nhands\\n\\nclap\\n\\nstamp\\n\\nfeet\\n\\nup\\n\\ndown\\n\\nwrite\\n\\nread\\n\\nSit down.\\n\\nStand up.\\n\\nClap your hands.\\n\\nTurn around.\\n', 0, 0, 'image', NULL, '2022-07-15 02:36:09', '2022-07-15 02:36:09'),
