(315491, 181, 216, 'The opposite word is a noun. It is a word that expresses a meaning as opposed to the importance of another word, in which case the two words are anton', 'The opposite word is a noun. It is a word that expresses a meaning as opposed to the importance of another word, in which case the two words are antonyms of each other.\\n\\nGood luck kids 🥰💞', 1, 0, 'image', NULL, '2022-11-19 16:09:40', '2022-11-19 16:09:40'),
